    {
      "content": "在地球表面附近，物体到地心的距离   r   近似等于地球半径   R ，   因此引力加速度可视为常数：   g = (G M)/R^2 ≈ 9.8 m ⋅ s^−2",
      "id": "lcn_8fa378e380a8d015",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "observations.near_earth_surface",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "newton_principia",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "newton_principia",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "setting"
    },
    {
      "content": "对于绕中心天体做圆周运动的物体，   所受引力与到天体中心距离   r   的平方成反比。   F ∝ 1/r^2",
      "id": "lcn_e96529ee10eb525d",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "derivation.inverse_square_force",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "newton_principia",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "newton_principia",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "万有引力定律：质量为   M   和   m_g   的两个物体之间的引力与两者质量之积成正比，   与距离的平方成反比。   F = (G M m_g)/r^2",
      "id": "lcn_c40e7630fea9c153",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "derivation.law_of_gravity",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "newton_principia",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "newton_principia",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "物体的惯性质量   m_i （决定对力的加速响应）   与引力质量   m_g （决定所受引力大小）相等。   m_i = m_g",
      "id": "lcn_334f23cefdb521e7",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "derivation.mass_equivalence",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "newton_principia",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "newton_principia",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "在地球表面附近，任何物体的自由落体加速度都等于   g ≈ 9.8   m/s²，与物体质量无关。",
      "id": "lcn_a2fce7dc9cd002eb",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "derivation.freefall_acceleration_equals_g",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "newton_principia",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "newton_principia",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "牛顿从力学定律出发的数学推导，与伽利略从思想实验出发的逻辑论证，   独立得出同一结论：自由落体加速度与物体质量无关。",
      "id": "lcn_d9a708604eb51daf",
